        "CVE-2018-19932"
    ],
    "details": "In `GCCBootstrap_jll` `9.4.0+0`, the affected target artifact is `aarch64-linux-gnu` (AArch64 Linux with glibc), which ships Binutils 2.29.1. The other target artifacts ship Binutils 2.38 and are outside the affected upstream range.\n\nAn issue was discovered in the Binary File Descriptor (BFD) library (aka libbfd), as distributed in GNU Binutils through 2.31. There is an integer overflow and infinite loop caused by the `IS_CONTAINED_BY_LMA` macro in elf.c.",
